---
skip_list:
  # Variables here are namespaced by product (wazuh_agent_version,
  # wazuh_manager_ip) rather than by role directory. Applying the rule
  # literally would give wazuh_agent_linux_wazuh_manager_ip, which costs the
  # person writing inventory more than the collision it prevents — every
  # variable in this repository already starts with wazuh_.
  - var-naming[no-role-prefix]
